      "The submission says that about 5,000 lines, including the verified compiler used by the factoring proof, were adapted from the authors' related work, but does not identify that earlier formalization. Readers cannot trace the provenance of this substantial reused component. Identify the earlier work in related_formalizations and explain the adaptation, or state clearly if the earlier work has no available identifier or location.",
